Privacy Policy for Scorekard360

Effective Date: [March 1, 2026 App Name: Scorekard360 Developer: Waleed Ahmad

1. Introduction

Scorekard360 is committed to protecting the privacy of families, athletes, and program providers. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application to review, rate, and explore youth sports programs.

2. Information We Collect

We may collect the following types of information:

• Personal Information: Name, email address, age range, and optional profile details
• Program Reviews & Ratings: User-generated content including comments, ratings, and feedback
• Usage Data: App interactions, features used, and engagement metrics
• Device Information: Device type, operating system, IP address
• Location Data: If permission is granted, we may use location to suggest nearby programs or events
3. How We Use Your Information

We use your data to:

• Display and organize program reviews and ratings
• Personalize recommendations based on location and preferences
• Improve app functionality and user experience
• Respond to support requests and feedback
• Communicate updates, promotions, or surveys (with your consent)
4. Data Sharing and Disclosure

We do not sell your personal data. We may share limited information with:

• Service Providers: For analytics, hosting, and customer support
• Program Providers: Aggregated, anonymized feedback to improve services
• Legal Authorities: If required by law or to protect user safety and rights
5. Data Security

We use industry-standard encryption and security protocols to protect your data. However, no method of transmission is completely secure.

6. Your Rights

You can:

• Access or update your profile information
• Request deletion of your account or data
• Withdraw consent for data processing
• Report concerns about content or privacy violations
7. Youth Privacy

Scorekard360 is designed for families and youth sports participants. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13 without verified parental consent. Parents or guardians may manage accounts and request data removal at any time.

8. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our practices or legal requirements. Updates will be posted in-app and on our website with the revised effective date.

9. Contact Us

For questions, concerns, or data requests, contact us at: 📧 [info@scorekard360.com] 🌐 [https://scorekard360.com]

 
